  "description": {
   "en": "During a biology class at school, a live frog was dissected. Manami, a high school girl who is not good at dissections, accidentally stabbed the frog's heart and killed it...! After that, Manami began to be attacked by strange phenomena. As Manami shuts herself in her room in fear, a teacher with a creepy smile appears before her...!? A collection of six short tales of bloody terror by splatter master Kaburagi Saiko. (Kaburagi Baku \u0026 Natsuki Hiura)\n\n◆Contains◆\n\n1: The Dissection [解剖• Horror House, 12/1987] \n2: A Burial [喰葬 • Pandora, 07/1988]\n3: Husbandry [飼育 • Pandora, 08/1988]\n4: The Living Rot [生き腐れ • Horror House, 03/1988]\n5: The Confession [告白 • Pandora, 07/1987]\n6: The Portrait of Dionne Colbert [ディオンヌ・コルベールの肖像 • Solitaire, 12/1986]\n\n*6 is Kaburagi Saiko's debut work"
  },
